    jl:hasAbstract "Notes I wrote in the catalog record:  Steinschneider ascribes the actual authorship to Saul b. Simon, writing in the literary allotment of Shem Tov ibn Palaqueirra. Pagination leaves out last two leaves, ending at no. 26. Pagan imagery on the colophon, with two crucifixes on each side." ;
