<http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/123def52-a591-580e-817d-cddbb6b8f26b> a gndo:Work ;
    gndo:associatedPlace "Neuwied" ;
    gndo:author "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/7b9d57ca-f3ec-5681-988f-4948cc623f21",
        "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/fb755ffc-34d3-57c1-9003-f9b148a2ba89" ;
    gndo:compiler "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/dc3e9f8f-f7ca-580b-8836-087f213f6ef6" ;
    gndo:dateOfPublication "1749" ;
    gndo:formerOwner "Baltimore Hebrew College",
        "Joseph Meyerhoff Collection, Towson University Library",
        "Rabbi Nechamkin",
        "Russian State Library",
        "Shelomoh ben Szender Bendit" ;
    gndo:language "Aramaic",
        "Hebrew" ;
    gndo:owner "Joseph Meyerhoff Collection, Towson University Library",
        "Russian State Library" ;
    gndo:printer "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/ad3a50dc-5146-507e-a983-3ef9942cec14",
        "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/e5087ee3-7537-53a3-b8f9-af7619fa2653" ;
    jl:describedAt "https://merhav.nli.org.il/primo-explore/search?query=any,contains,000144648&tab=default_tab&search_scope=Local&vid=NLI&lang=en_US&offset=0",
        "https://merhav.nli.org.il/primo-explore/search?query=any,contains,001223231&tab=default_tab&search_scope=Local&vid=NLI&lang=en_US&offset=0",
        "https://search.worldcat.org/de/title/762374307" ;
    jl:hasAbstract "",
        "Notes by Chaim Meiselman:  Approbations of David Oppenheim of Prague (n.d), Jacob Joshua Falk of Frankfurt (Passover 1748), Ele’azar Rokeakh of Amsterdam (17 Heshvan 1738), Yehezkel Katzenellenbogen of Altona-Hamburg-Wandsbek (1730), Yehiel-Mikhel of Berlin, Zvi-Hirsch of Halberstadt, Samuel Heilman of Mannheim, Juda Muller of Cologne-Münster, Juda-Lob of Staszów, Wolff Sirkes of Wodzislaw, Moses Hagiz (Jerusalem-Altona), Meir b.Benjamin Wolff of Hannover, Mordekhai b. Zvi-Hirsch of Leszno, Judah Lipshutz of Amsterdam, and Moses of Lvov.   Author’s statement, end of Vol. 1: Finished on Monday, the first day of Chanukah, 5509 (25th of Kislev, 5509 = Mon, 16 December 1748). Perhaps this note actually was written at the end of composing the entire volume, judging the publication date.   Title illustrations: Architechtural scheme. On the bottom, a bearded Jacob sleeps while angels ascend the ladder; female angelc figures flank the circular woodcut. Above, Moses and Aaron in full garb. On top, embossed flora surrounding cherubim depicted as doves, flanked by large male angelic figures.   ‫ / ... חובר ... עי ... ר’ אליעזר בן ... ר’ שלמה זלמן ליפשיץ ... שהיה לפנים בישראל אבד ורמ דקק אוסטראווצי ואגפיה וכסאו מוטל בין גדולי רומי בכמה וכמה קהלות ... וכעת מזלו נשתדד בקק נייאוויט ... ובתוכה רצוף ... שות וחדושי דינים מבנו ... ר’ ישראל אבד דקק הדמר ... וגם חדושי דינים מאחיו ... ר’ אפרים ... ‬ Translation: Authored by Rabbi Eli’ezer, son of R. Shelomoh Zalman Lipschutz, who was formerly Head of Courts of the Community in Ostrovitsi (Gmina Ostrowice, Pomerania-Poland); his position is placed with the great ones of Rom.I. (רומי = רבבני מתא [ב]ישראל? - possibly the Rabbis of Cities of Israel, a play-of-words on Gedole Romi, the Elders of Rome) in many many communities; now, his lot has placed him in the Holy Community of Neivveit (Neuwied - Rhineland-Palatinate, Germany); inside, is placed She’elot u-Teshuvot ... of his son, R. Yisra’el, Av-Beth-Din of Hadamar (Hesse-Germany) ... and more novellae of the law from his brother ... Efra’im.   Printing information from second title. Second title also has two three-star schemes, differing from the main title.   Vol. 2, entitled Dameśeḳ Eliʻezer, hidushim on Turim and Bet Yosef, volumes Yoreh deah and Hoshen mishpat, edited by his son Solomon.   Steinschneider, M. Cat. librorum hebraeorum, 4999 : 1." ;
    dc:contributor "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/1acf40a2-10df-5d2e-aa70-07c520d4664d",
        "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/352f33dd-fd5c-511c-a85b-d34768dcce55",
        "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/997a8a46-6a6d-5e7f-9be1-7a0f9acf9433",
        "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/ad726297-3c91-5991-864a-1898dcee45fa",
        "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/b5492842-7298-576c-9f9a-bc25adc0de95",
        "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/c5221993-e50e-5078-94db-453dad64a0c3",
        "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/fe2f91fb-ec0e-5656-a36f-e2400563f581" ;
    dc:title "She'elot u-Teshuvot (Eliezer b. Solomon Lipshutz)" ;
    dcterms:created "2024-03-17T22:22:52.804117"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:prefLabel "She'elot u-Teshuvot (Eliezer b. Solomon Lipshutz)" .

