    jl:hasAbstract "",
        "Berlin and Frankfurt on der Oder",
        "See Marvin Heller's article about the Bomberg printings of hte Talmud: http://www.jewishhistory.com/PRINTINGTHETALMUD/essays/7.pdf He notes that in editions where the page number is to the right of the name of the tractate, this signifies the copy was part of the first printing (1520-23). Some of the volumes had no tractate name, but by the second printing the tractate always appeared with the page to the left of the name of the tractate." ;
    dc:title "Talmud. Bekhorot" ;
    dcterms:created "2024-03-18T00:50:30.131054"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:prefLabel "Talmud. Bekhorot" .

