    jl:hasAbstract "",
        "Subtitle: (נקרא, אשר דרש וחקר ועשה אזנים לתורה ... בכל פרשה ... פשט ומדרש ... שכל ... קבלה ...).BHB note: אוצר 74 A  Assortment of citations and notes: Offenberg, Hebrew incunabula in public collections, no. 8; Steinschneider, Cat. Bodl.,4525 (1); Proctor, no. 6737; Wiener, Kohel. Mos., no. 1092; Van Straalen, p.17; Goff, H-6; Offenburg, no.8; Iakerson, no. 5; 'Treasures of the Valmadonna Trust', 48.With a running title and imprint; opening prose text, and final words by Bonfoi-Tsarfati on leaves 286b and 287a. See Friedberg, Haim David, History of Hebrew Print in Italy, Tel Aviv 1956, pp. 47.Printed without a title and pagination, but with collation signatures. Opening text by the author, ḳevod ḥakhamim yinḥalu ...  Printed double-column, with names of biblical portion heading the columns." ;
