    jl:hasAbstract "",
        "Subtitle: (שחבר... רבנא משה... בן הרב ר' מיימון). [עם הפנים].<br />BHB note: אוצר 73 A",
        "The Giustiniani printer's device is on each title, featuring the Temple in Jerusalem. There are woodcut decorated initials on the opening word of each tractate.  Layout: The text of the Mishnah is in square type, followed by the commentary of Moses Maimonides in small cursive type; commentary begins after each Mishnah. The introduction to Seder Nashim by R. Jacob ibn Abbasi (with the correspondence to R. Solomon ibn Adret) is printed at the end of volume three." ;
    dc:publisher "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/1818b22e-b8e3-5e80-9b23-9362f19dacde",
        "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/31024910-3ef1-550d-82c7-971ab191dac3" ;
    dc:title "Mishnah. Commentaries (Maimonides)" ;
    dcterms:created "2024-03-17T18:57:58.804144"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:prefLabel "Mishnah. Commentaries (Maimonides)" .

