    jl:hasAbstract "",
        "Primarily a philosophical, theological, ethical and to some extent historical commentary, Abrabanel’s method as an exegete is entirely novel, prefacing each section of each Book with a number of questions and then interpreting that section in such a manner as to gradually resolve them. The preface includes Abrabanel’s account of his life in Spain and the subsequent Expulsion." ;
    dc:publisher "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/15fcabf0-1813-5624-aeb8-e8fc2140e851",
