<http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/47da0113-296d-5d8d-9df8-013b41ced774> a gndo:Work ;
    gndo:associatedPlace "Alduna",
        "אלטונא" ;
    gndo:author "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/53cd862c-51de-55f3-80eb-79a9eafa27c9" ;
    gndo:dateOfPublication "January 1733" ;
    gndo:formerOwner "Baltimore Hebrew College",
        "Joseph Meyerhoff Collection, Towson University Library",
        "Shelomoh b. Zalman Hegelberg (Wandsbek)" ;
    gndo:language "Aramaic",
        "Hebrew" ;
    gndo:owner "Joseph Meyerhoff Collection, Towson University Library" ;
    gndo:printer "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/20537a94-e3eb-53e7-960c-6d2ffce62205" ;
    jl:describedAt "https://merhav.nli.org.il/primo-explore/search?query=any,contains,000301960&tab=default_tab&search_scope=Local&vid=NLI&lang=en_US&offset=0" ;
    jl:hasAbstract "<p>Begun at the begining of Elul (August-September) 1732, finished Bekhi-Tov Shvat (January) 1733. Likely Bekhi-Tov is referring to the closing of the month. Decorated title: embossed rectangle scheme on an architechture-esque picture surrounding title statement. At the apex, a lion ascends a fortress under a single six-pointed star.Folio. Double-columns, title heading, and leaf count at outer corners. BenJakob, Otsar ha-Sefarim,lamed 135.First and only printing.Friedberg, Beit Eked Sefarim,lamed 275. Title derived from Proverbs 1:9, כי לוית חן הם לראשך וענקים לגרגרתיך , 'They are a garland to grace your head'. Steinschneider, op. cit., Corona Gratiae. Steinschneider, M. Cat. Libr. Bodl.,4894:2. Haskamot of Yehezkel b. Avrahm Katsenellenbogen of Altona, dated 5 Tevet 1733; Moses Hagiz, 1733 - afterwords imploring the author not to receive approbations from other authorities. CM</p>" ;
    dc:title "Livyat Hen (Heckscher, Efraim)" ;
    dcterms:created "2024-03-17T17:04:21.695341"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:prefLabel "Livyat Hen (Heckscher, Efraim)" .

