    jl:hasAbstract "",
        "<p>This is an expanded edition of the homiletic / kabbalistic commentary of Moses Alshech (or Alshich) on the order of the Pentateuch. The volume was printed numerous times during the 17th and 18th centuries, with varied editions. This edition is enlarged and expanded and printed with dual Haskamot of the Sefardic and Ashkenazic rabbis of Amsterdam, Saul Salem and Saul Lowenstamm.Printed in double columns.Friedberg, B. Bet eked sefarim,#1119:5BM Hebrew,p. 568Jewish Encycl.,v.1, p. 463-464</p>" ;
    dc:publisher "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/ab80ec6a-10dc-5603-b194-fb44cf6593b1",
        "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/c9b3c84b-9f26-5119-88e5-76fa191b88bf" ;
    dc:title "Bible. Pentateuch. Commentaries (Alshekh)" ;
    dcterms:created "2024-03-17T13:45:52.097822"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:prefLabel "Bible. Pentateuch. Commentaries (Alshekh)" .

