        "אמשטרדם" ;
    gndo:author "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/265599a7-a5d1-5e50-b7ce-217e7847d9e1" ;
    gndo:dateOfPublication "1691" ;
    gndo:formerOwner "Baltimore Hebrew College",
        "Feittl Yoresh b. Efraim ha-kohen mi-k.k. A'A (Ostrog?)",
        "Joseph Meyerhoff Collection, Towson University Library",
        "Mosheh b. Bereleh",
        "Shelomoh Zalman b. Yehoshua Sohrels" ;
    gndo:language "Hebrew" ;
    gndo:owner "Joseph Meyerhoff Collection, Towson University Library" ;
    gndo:printer "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/7d2903af-6989-5c58-8126-efa921ef9a29",
        "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/a2aab3fe-98bc-5d85-ae28-45d39cbfcc74" ;
    jl:describedAt "https://merhav.nli.org.il/primo-explore/search?query=any,contains,001978808&tab=default_tab&search_scope=Local&vid=NLI&lang=en_US&offset=0" ;
    jl:hasAbstract "Homiletic introduction by Shelomoh Zalman Shteinne-kopf, who signs as living in Prag and subsequently Bomseyleh (Mladá Boleslav, Bohemia). See the extensive note by Steinschneider on the editing and attributions of certain novellae to this editor. cf. Steinschneider, Cat. Lib. Bodl., 6950:2 & 3 together.  Printed in small block. Woodcuts throughout, and illustrations on portions dealing with 'Eruvin and Bava Batra.  Imprint note: ונדפס בכרך קטן כדי שכל אחד יוכל לשאת אותו בחיקו ובאפונדתו; trans. printed in a miniature volume that anyone may carry it in their load, or in their belt.  Colophon: ʻAl yede ha-poʻel ... Yiśśakhar b[en] ... Eliʻezer Shaliṭ ... niḳra ... Ber Zetsir." ;
    dc:publisher "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/a10f1d30-69a6-513f-a2f0-9da7a75e65fc" ;
    dc:title "Ḥokhmat Shelomoh" ;
    dcterms:created "2024-03-17T15:38:39.405233"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:prefLabel "Ḥokhmat Shelomoh" .

