    jl:hasAbstract "",
        "<p>This imprint of Pirkei Avot has Samuel ben Yehudah ibn Tibbon's introduction that he wrote to his Hebrew translation of Maimonides' commentary on Pirkei Avot. This can be found at the beginning of the imprint.</p>",
        "Not listed in Vinograd or BHB.",
        "The translator, the English scholar Abraham Tang (d. 1792) was a grandson of the Dayan of Prague, Abraham Tausig Neu-Greschel. Like his grandfather, the author signed his name with the Hebrew initials TN”G, and is thus generally known as Tang." ;
