        "The Library of The Jewish Theological Seminary",
        "Ya'akov ben Avraham" ;
    gndo:language "Aramaic",
        "Hebrew" ;
    gndo:owner "Beinecke Rare Book and Manuscript Library, Yale University",
        "Columbia University Libraries",
        "Josephus Mona Lesser",
        "Russian State Libary",
        "Russian State Library",
        "Salli Kirschstein",
        "The Library of The Jewish Theological Seminary" ;
    gndo:printer "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/63925f45-10a8-54da-a4ed-023f8a4bbba5",
        "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/bda6eac2-ff99-5adb-a105-15ff715e7c40" ;
    jl:describedAt "https://merhav.nli.org.il/primo-explore/search?query=any,contains,000333345&tab=default_tab&search_scope=Local&vid=NLI&lang=en_US&offset=0",
        "https://merhav.nli.org.il/primo-explore/search?query=any,contains,000334101&tab=default_tab&search_scope=Local&vid=NLI&lang=en_US&offset=0",
        "https://merhav.nli.org.il/primo-explore/search?query=any,contains,000334234&tab=default_tab&search_scope=Local&vid=NLI&lang=en_US&offset=0",
        "https://merhav.nli.org.il/primo-explore/search?query=any,contains,000334361&tab=default_tab&search_scope=Local&vid=NLI&lang=en_US&offset=0",
        "https://merhav.nli.org.il/primo-explore/search?query=any,contains,000334430&tab=default_tab&search_scope=Local&vid=NLI&lang=en_US&offset=0",
        "https://search.worldcat.org/de/title/122884783",
        "https://search.worldcat.org/de/title/711793600" ;
    jl:hasAbstract "",
        "<p>See the record for Talmud Rosh Hashanah in the Bibliography of the Hebrew Book which states that editions that claim to be of the second printing are of the third printing when they have the date 1531 and not 1530. These 1531 editions that were believed to be part of Bomberg's 3rd printing of the Talmud do not have the Hebrew month, Kisleiv, and this is one of those imprints. Bibliography of the Hebrew book has the following note: י&rsquo; ריבקינד (דקדוקי ספרים, ספר היובל לכבוד א&rsquo; מארכס, נויורק תשי, עמ&rsquo; תיב-תיג) מעיר שקיימים טפסים עם התאריך רצא, אך הם אינם מהמהדורה הנוכחית (אלא ממהד&rsquo; ג). אין שם בחדש כסליו וכמו כן לא מופיע בהם שמו של אדיל קינד. ‬</p>",
        "<p>This is from Bomberg's second print run of the Bavli, all of these at HUC JIR are marked as copy 3.</p>",
        "It does not look from the BHB that tractates Rosh Hashanah, Yoma, Sukkah, Ta'anit, Yerushalmi Shekalim and Megillah could have been bound together beginning in 1644 as they came off the press one at a time in years stretching until 1648. Possibly once they were all printed they were bound together, I am just not sure when. The title page indicates that Immanuel Benveniste relied on the printed edition of Marco Antonio Giustiniani (Venice, 1546-1551).",
        "Note that this imprint was a shared publication between presses located in two locations--Berlin and Frankfort de Odor." ;
    dc:publisher "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/1e72af43-2616-5d41-b875-747489f48f8c",
        "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/8f526c62-682a-5a01-a426-0d79bae1f935" ;
    dc:title "Talmud. Rosh Hashanah" ;
    dcterms:created "2024-03-18T01:06:43.751384"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:prefLabel "Talmud. Rosh Hashanah" .

