        "Russian State Library",
        "Stephen Samuel Wise",
        "Talmud Torah di Venezia",
        "Temple Emanu-el",
        "The Library of the Katz Center for Advanced Judaic Studies",
        "Yeshiva Tomchei Temimim",
        "Yoel b. Yishai Segal \"\"Heitschtön\" (Hartstone?)",
