<http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/9a95de64-92ad-57ce-b983-341dad64784e> a gndo:Work ;
    gndo:associatedPlace "Zhovkva" ;
    gndo:author "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/27fce2ea-4211-5bf5-8ffe-f7a1111fee66" ;
    gndo:dateOfPublication "August 31, 1704" ;
    gndo:ditor "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/01955b9d-9698-5ed3-89e5-6eb74bd21e2a",
        "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/63e4f49e-3c6f-5b2e-8c26-92f182fc5550" ;
    gndo:language "Hebrew" ;
    gndo:printer "http://data.judaicalink.org/data/footprints/ef20ab9b-6100-5b7e-9b49-3b9dd86f422e" ;
    jl:hasAbstract "Text in Hebrew, with a portion in Yiddish (f. 8 verso). There are two title pages, the first with the title Seder sheḥiṭot u-vediḳot and the second with the title Seder bediḳot. The first part is about the inspection of the slaughtering knife and the laws of kosher slaughter, and the second is about the inspection of the animal for imperfections which would render it unkosher (such as imperfections in the lungs and heart chambers. Titles within an architectural border. The printers device of Uri ben Aaron ha-Levi is on the verso of each title page (two fish, and a pitcher pouring water) and a final on the last page. Also found on the upper framing of the title pages. Title acknowledges the reigning monarch, Augustus II the Strong (1670-1733), referring to him as Friedrich Augustus. Text of the halakhic code of R. Jacob Weill is in the upper center of each page in square print, with his commentary surrounding it in smaller print. Signatures: [1-6]⁴.  Not in the Bibliography of the Hebrew Book. Vinograd, |c Zolkiew 20Title indicates that the editors of the volume were descendants (or relatives) of the printer, Shelomoh b. Mosheh Ṿelḥ (ועלח, or Wolch) and Aharon b. Daṿid ha-Levi.  Illustrations on f. 5 verso are of slaughter knife blades, showing a kosher knife and three types of imperfections on knives. Also shown on f. 16 recto are openings of the Bronchial Tree, using a bold square samekh (ס) turned sidewards." ;
    dc:title "Seder sheḥiṭot u-vediḳot" ;
    dcterms:created "2024-03-17T21:03:57.372924"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:prefLabel "Seder sheḥiṭot u-vediḳot" .

