    jl:hasAbstract "",
        "Subtitle: [עם פירוש רשי ותוספות ופסקי תוספות].<br />BHB note: אוצר 54 A.",
        "There was an edition of the Talmud published in Berlin in 1720-22 and then another edition that was printed in 1734-9.  This is the only volume at Yale that I could find that was part of the 1720 printing. However, it has the same call number as the 1734-9 volumes (Berlin/Frankfurt de Odor) and was acquired with the 1734-9 volumes." ;
