    jl:hasAbstract "",
        "Abraham Hazkuni (b.1627), a rabbi from Cracow and the student of Yom Tov Lipmann Heller, wrote Shete Yadot originally as a commentary on the Zohar, but it was lost by the printer. His son, Jacob, published his father's commentary on the Torah using the same name." ;
