    jl:hasAbstract "This imprint has 'Ayash's responsa followed by his work on the minhagim of Algeria. The LoC identifier is for that attached work, rather than for the responsa.  This is a collection of responsa regarding the customs (dating back to the 15th century) of the Jews of Algiers. It was authored by the prominent rabbi of Algiers, Yehudah Ayash (d. 1760)." ;
