    jl:hasAbstract "Approbations from Italian Sefardic Rabbis David Malakh, Isaac Castillio, Meir b. Pinhas Sanguinetti; Hananya Mazal-Tov Bundi, Israel Sirossi, Eliyahu ha-kohen; Israel Binyamin b. Yoshia'hu Bassan; David ha-Kohen of Modena. These names are to be found in Marco Mortara, Mazkeret Hakhmei Italia - Indice Alfabetico dei Rabbini E Scrittori Israeliti, Padova, F.Sacchetto, 1886. Approbations from Ashkenazic Rabbis from the authors' Poland include Solomon of Chelmno, 1717-1781 (a native of Zamosc), Dov-Ber of Koznice-Zamosc. Commentaries on tractates Eruvin, Pesahim, Bezah, Yoma, Yevamot and Temurah.  Steinschneider, M. Cat. librorum hebraeorum,#6825:1.  - Chaim Meiselman" ;
