    jl:hasAbstract "All notes by Chaim Meiselman:  This is a volume of Talmudic novellae on the tractates of Ketubot and Gitin written by Śimḥa-Bunem Rapaport, the rabbinical head (rosh av beth-din) of the Wallerstein district in Bavaria, Germany.Ornaments decorate the title with a printer's device.The author's name is abbreviated on the title to Rashbats, from Rabbi Simhah ben Tsevi." ;
