    jl:hasAbstract "Hebrew and some Portuguese.In each volume Seder Hafṭarot ... ke-minhag ha-Sefaradim ṿeha-Ashkenazim has special title leaf with date in chronogram totalling 528 [1767 or 1768].End of volume 5 includes Luḥot ha-ʻibur = Calendario, Hebrew and Portuguese, dated 5529 [1768 or 1769].Text with vocalization and cantilation marks, enumerated verses and chapters, with instructions for the Torah scribe and reader. Published concurrently with the non-vocalized edition. Cf. BHB.Printed marginalia." ;
    dc:title "Bible. Tikun Soferim (Spanish & Portugese Cahal edition)" ;
    dcterms:created "2024-03-17T14:26:18.850014"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:prefLabel "Bible. Tikun Soferim (Spanish & Portugese Cahal edition)" .

